Scenarios in this directory are translations of test methods from XMage's
Mage.Tests module (https://github.com/magefree/mage). Each scenario's "xmage"
field names the originating Class#method.

The combat, continuous, copy, replacement and triggers families, and the
hand-ported layers family, were translated at commit
6b602a1c85e8ed738a4b40b1ef44c54845b57f68.

The abilities, asthough, conditional, control, cost, damage, dynamicvalue, enchantments,
filters, mana, modal, planeswalker, prevention, protection, requirement,
restriction, rules, sba, single, targets and watchers families were translated at commit
4142596fb72b9dc03a0eae0ec34f4544cfd6d59e.

